N5008 [over.match.list]/2.2, [over.match.ctor], [temp.deduct]: constructor
templates participate in list-initialization of a class from a braced-init-list.
Constructing a std::pair-like class (element-wise ctor is a template) from
`{a, b}` was previously rejected as "found no match".  Root cause of the
dominant "no match for symbol 'insert'" dog-food cluster (std::unordered_map).
